OL,3,GNEWSAQueen joins survivors at domestic
OL,4,Aviolence summit
OL,5,
OL,6,FQueen Camilla has attended a summit
OL,7,Fworking to end violence against women
OL,8,Fand girls.
OL,10,FThe summit was arranged by Ending
OL,11,FViolence Against Women and Girls
OL,12,F(EVAWG) Wiltshire and also included
OL,13,Fjudges, MPs, police officers and
OL,14,Fsurvivors at a day of talks at
OL,15,FMarlborough College.
OL,17,FSpeakers spoke of the need for a
OL,18,Fjoined-up approach between agencies
OL,19,Finvolved in tackling the issue and the
OL,20,Fimportant role that education can play.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,350,340,200,160,0,100
