OL,3,GNEWSAQueen joins survivors at domestic
OL,4,Aviolence summit
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Teenagers are now the biggest age
OL,7,Fgroup where domestic abuse is
OL,8,Fhappening, so education has to be part
OL,9,Fof that, not just health and policing,"
OL,10,FJulie Devey, who has campaigned for law
OL,11,Fchanges and awareness after her
OL,12,Fdaughter, Poppy, was murdered by her
OL,13,Fex-boyfriend, said.
